/**
 * A pull quote in the right rail.
 *
 * Floated rather than grid placed on purpose. A grid cell in a second column
 * would take a whole row, leaving a hole in the prose beside it. A float with
 * a negative right margin sits in the rail and lets the text flow past, which
 * is exactly what the print version of this does.
 */
